// [👤semio📚js💻semio🔖kit🪨getcollectiondiff](repo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/f/semio.ts/s/Kit/d/i/getCollectionDiff)
// getCollectionDiff holds the data fields for a getCollectionDiff record.
