// [👤semio📚js💻semio🔖kit🔖validation🔖constraintdesignpiecesamefamilyconstraint](repo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/f/semio.ts/s/Kit/s/Validation/s/Constraint:%20Design%20piece%20same%20family%20constraint)
