 * MUST return the requested value.
 * [👤semio📚js💻semio🔖kit🔖typefamilyhelpers🪨gettypechildren](repo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/f/semio.ts/s/Kit/s/Type%20Family%20Helpers/d/i/getTypeChildren)
