// [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻hometsx🔖app🔖multiwindowapp](repo://section/SEMIO/JS/SKETCHPAD/HOME.TSX/APP/MULTI-WINDOW-APP)
// Multi-window app MUST orchestrate the Home canvas and layout.

/**
