// [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻sketchpad🔖apps🔖sketchpad🪨performancelogtimestamps](semiorepo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Sketchpad.tsx/s/Apps/s/Sketchpad/d/i/performanceLogTimestamps)
