// [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻design🔖imports🔖panels🔖canvas🔖diagram🪨clustermenu](repo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Design.tsx/s/Imports/s/Panels/s/Canvas/s/Diagram/d/i/ClusterMenu)
